OL,3,GNEWSAFacial recognition cameras to be
OL,4,Aused again
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers plan to use live facial
OL,7,Frecognition cameras once again in three
OL,8,Ftowns.
OL,10,FSuffolk Police said it made four
OL,11,Farrests and scanned 80,000 faces when
OL,12,Fit used the technology in Ipswich,
OL,13,FLowestoft and Bury St Edmunds in
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FThe force said it would help "keep
OL,17,Fpeople safe" when it used it again in
OL,18,Fthe towns next week.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
