OL,3,GNEWSAFacial recognition cameras to be
OL,4,Aused again
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk's police and crime
OL,7,Fcommissioner, Conservative Tim
OL,8,FPassmore, said the cameras had "huge
OL,9,Fpotential to bring criminals to justice
OL,10,Fand prevent crime."
